"Feature requests or bugs? Please visit <a href=\"https://github.com/"
"corecoding/Vitals/issues\">GitHub</a>. No warranty, expressed or implied. <a "
"href=\"https://corecoding.com/donate.php\">Donate</a> if you found this "
